          "chapter": 3,
          "verse": 11
        }
      ],
      "en": "Go out, you daughters of Zion, and see King Solomon, with the crown with which his mother has crowned him, in the day of his weddings, in the day of the gladness of his heart.",
      "ko": "시온의 여자들아 나와서 솔로몬왕을 보라 혼인날 마음이 기쁠 때에 그 모친의 씌운 면류관이 그 머리에 있구나",
      "source_text_hash": "5f4909f894f8da96a39f894b880e60496c3159fd43dbd1dd536957b6f74fa811",
      "translation_text_hash": "64724dc166e3745085c4650f318d12266fe313ef980ccb817dffdb36488c6b5e",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
